[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3]

; Sim-to-deploy regression for the NumPy chase twin (#37): the policy was trained entirely in
; Python on scripts/chase_twin_env.py (no Godot, no socket), exported to ncnn, and must still catch
; targets in the REAL Godot chase engine — proving the twin reproduced the Godot dynamics. Reuses
; the standard trained-chase behavioral checker.

